{"id":"exhibit","name":"Exhibit","tagline":"Preview your 3D models","blurb":"Based on the F3D library, it supports many file formats, from digital content to scientific datasets including glTF, STL, STEP, PLY, OBJ, FBX, USD, Alembic and many more.","description":"Based on the F3D library, it supports many file formats, from digital content to scientific\ndatasets including glTF, STL, STEP, PLY, OBJ, FBX, USD, Alembic and many more. You can drag\nand drop 3d models into the app and export an image of the rendered model. Change many\nsettings like tone mapping, ambient occlusion, anti aliasing, material roughness, metallic,\ncolor and opacity to achieve the perfect render. You can use an HDRI image or a custom color\nas a background.","developer":"Nokse","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/icons/128x128/io.github.nokse22.Exhibit.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-1_752x534@1.png","w":1050,"h":747},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-2_752x534@1.png","w":1050,"h":747},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-3_752x534@1.png","w":1050,"h":747},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/nokse22.Exhibit/9ad7f644c0f6cb0af990eba6e5717db8/screenshots/image-4_752x53